(function(){var C=window.__CLIPS||(window.__CLIPS={});var d={"Press Begin when you are ready.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Worked example.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Yes.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Not quite yet. Have another look, or use a hint.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Not quite yet. That's fine. You can try again, or move on without an answer.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Choose an answer first.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Type your answer first.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Put all of them in order first.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Sort all of them first.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "You explored new possibilities.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "New idea explored.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "You worked through something difficult.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Challenge explored.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "You stayed with the challenge.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Strong persistence.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "You tried a different approach when your first idea did not work.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "New strategy discovered.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "You kept trying.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Learning continued.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "You looked carefully before deciding.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Careful observation.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Coping with emotions.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Today I am practising naming feelings and finding healthy ways to cope.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "All feelings are normal.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Everyone feels angry, disappointed or sad sometimes. Feelings are normal. What matters is what we do with them.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Healthy ways to cope.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Healthy ways to cope include breathing slowly, taking a break, moving your body, and talking to someone you trust.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Empathy.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Empathy means trying to understand how someone else feels. Compassion means wanting to help.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Lebo's drawing was torn by accident. She feels angry. What could she do?": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "First, name the feeling: \"I feel angry.\"": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Then calm her body: breathe slowly or step away for a moment.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Then talk about it, or decide whether to fix or redo the drawing.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Sam was not chosen for the team. How might he feel?": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Disappointed": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Excited": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Bored": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Sleepy": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "He hoped for something that did not happen.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "This feeling comes when hopes are not met.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "It starts with \"dis…\".": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Not being chosen when you hoped to be can make you feel disappointed.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Sort these ways of coping with anger.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Helpful ways keep you and others safe.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Would it hurt someone or something?": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Calming down and talking are helpful.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Breathing, taking a break and talking are helpful. Hurting, breaking and insulting are not.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Your friend's pet died and they are sad. What shows empathy?": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "\"I'm sorry. That must be really hard.\"": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "\"It was just a pet.\"": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "\"Let's talk about something else.\"": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Laugh to cheer them up": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Empathy means understanding their feeling.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Which answer shows you understand?": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "It is kind and gentle.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Saying you are sorry and that it must be hard shows you understand how they feel.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "What is a good first step when you feel a big emotion?": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Name the feeling": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Pretend you feel nothing": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Make a quick decision": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Blame someone": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Knowing what you feel helps you choose what to do.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "\"I feel …\"": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Putting a name to it is the first step.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Naming the feeling helps you understand it and choose a healthy way to cope.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Which person is the BEST to talk to when a feeling is too big?": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "A grown-up you trust": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "A stranger online": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Nobody": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Someone who teases you": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "You want someone safe who can help.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Think of a parent, teacher or carer.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Someone you trust.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "A trusted grown-up can listen and help you stay safe.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Which way of coping would you try?": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Breathing slowly": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Taking a break": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Talking to someone": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Not sure": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Every feeling is allowed. You get to choose what you do with it.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Emotion. a feeling, like happy, sad or angry.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Disappointed. sad because something you hoped for did not happen.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Empathy. trying to understand how someone else feels.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Cope. deal with something in a healthy way.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,"};for(var k in d)C[k]=d[k];})();
